OL,3,CProgramme listings for TUE 10 FEB
OL,4,G0930FEssential Classics
OL,5,     GIan Skelly plays the best in
OL,6,     Gclassical music, with discoveries
OL,7,     Gand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,8,     Gwith familiar favourites.
OL,9,G1300FClassical Live
OL,10,     GLinton Stephens with an afternoon
OL,11,     Gof great concert performances
OL,12,     Gincluding Beethoven's Pastoral
OL,13,     GSymphony with Renaud Capucon and
OL,14,     GSaint-Saens's Egyptian-inspired
OL,15,     Gpiano concerto.
OL,16,G1600FComposer of the Week: Schutz
OL,17,     GDonald Macleod sees Schutz endure
OL,18,     Gthe death of his wife, after only
OL,19,     Gsix years of marriage, and
OL,20,     Gexplores the music he composed to
OL,21,     Gmark her parting.
